<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.signer.rotates ~ the place's online signer, replaced by its founding card

`lares vessel rotate` reads the place's founding card on a terminal, mints the replacement signer and reads its card back before anything lands. A standing vessel refuses (its signer would outlive the rotation), as does a card that opens no commitment or a read-back that differs. `--cold-key <card>` stands in for the terminal on a staged test root alone.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ rotate

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`rotate` params=`~ rotate at a terminal, the vessel stopped`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ cold-key · root

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`cold-key` params=`takes/card ~ the founding card, on a staged test root alone`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`root` params=`takes/dir ~ the vessel root (LAR_ROOT) this call reads`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand ~ reads the founding card at a person's own terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ vessel-stands · no-terminal · cold-key-staged-only · ColdKeyCardError · CardReadBackRefused · place-card-refused · place-rotation-torn · place-rotation-raced

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-stands` params=`~ a vessel stands here; stop it with lares vessel stop, then rotate`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`no-terminal` params=`~ the rite reads the card on a terminal`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`cold-key-staged-only` params=`~ --cold-key stands in on a staged test root alone`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`ColdKeyCardError` params=`~ the card reads malformed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`CardReadBackRefused` params=`~ the replacement card read back otherwise`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`place-card-refused` params=`~ the card opens no commitment; nothing moved`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`place-rotation-torn` params=`~ the rotation tore; nothing moved`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`place-rotation-raced` params=`~ another rotation raced; nothing moved`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

