!! answers ~ rotated · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`rotated` params=`exit/0 ~ the new signer stands`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/2 ~ refused by name; nothing moved`>>
```

